  "solution": "Ta có số lượng cá thể trong đàn tại thời điểm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>t</mi></semantics></math> là<br>\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tDo đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tVì <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, nên suy ra<br>\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tVậy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tDo đó, số cá thể của đàn gấu mèo tại thời điểm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>3</mn></semantics></math> tháng là<br>\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>226</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>",
